   "source": [
    "from refwindcycle.core.cyclist_params import (\n",
    "                 CyclistBehavior, \n",
    "                 create_competitive_profile\n",
    ")\n",
    "# I choose a competitive profile \n",
    "my_profile = create_competitive_profile()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Doing that, I choose a réalistic behavior for all types of terrain, \n",
    "# To have the same profile, I could just as easily have written\n",
    "my_profile=CyclistBehavior(uphill='realistic', \n",
    "                           downhill='realistic', \n",
    "                           corner='realistic')\n",
    "\n",
    "# At any time you can display your profile to check it looks as expected\n",
    "my_profile.display()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a08dbf68",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "452badc1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Subsequently, it is possible to create a more complex profile by:\n",
    "\n",
    "- combining the 3 types of behavior in different ways, \n",
    "\n",
    "- specifically and very finely modify a subset or even all of the factors that define the power variations associated with the different types of slope and turns. "
   ]
